      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7514121::web::002::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "NbMoTaW has poor room-temperature ductility.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7514121::web::002::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The irradiation tolerance of NbMoTaW is uncertain.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed intervention is to add approximately 3–5 at.% V, or alternatively Cr, to NbMoTaW.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A 3–5 at.% V addition will improve the room-temperature ductility of NbMoTaW.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A 3–5 at.% Cr addition will improve the room-temperature ductility of NbMoTaW.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10179711::web::002::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Minor V addition can preserve the BCC structure and elevated-temperature strength of NbMoTaW.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7514121::web::002::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Minor Cr addition can preserve the BCC structure and elevated-temperature strength of NbMoTaW.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10179711::web::002::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding V or Cr will produce slight, controlled lattice distortion in NbMoTaW.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7514121::web::002::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The dopant-induced lattice distortion will lower the Peierls barrier.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A lower Peierls barrier will enhance dislocation mobility and thereby improve ductility.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "V or Cr addition will enhance recombination of irradiation-induced defects.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The modified alloy will form fewer or smaller irradiation defects, including dislocation loops and helium bubbles, than untreated NbMoTaW.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10154406::web::003::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The modified alloy will show less irradiation-induced amorphization than untreated NbMoTaW.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Keeping the V or Cr concentration at 3–5 at.% will prevent deleterious secondary-phase formation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cr- and V-rich precipitates can be detrimental to mechanical properties through embrittlement.",
      "field": "uncertainty",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10154406::web::003::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The predicted balance applies up to 1600 °C and under helium implantation near 40 keV and 2 × 10^17 ions/cm².",
      "field": "boundary",
